# Optional. Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables reach the app bundle.
#
# Leave this unset during development: the app reads the Expo dev server's LAN
# address and points itself at http://<that-host>:4000, so a phone running
# Expo Go on the same Wi-Fi connects with no typing.
#
# Set it for a production build to bake in the Cloudflare Tunnel address.
# Whatever is saved in-app under More → Server settings always wins over this.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.sattadhartextile.example
